        "darwin-x64",
        "linux-x64",
        "linux-arm64",
        "win32-x64"
      ],
      "homepage": "https://github.com/KhronosGroup/glTF-Validator",
      "rationale": "The GLB encoder is first-party. The Khronos validator is the specification authority's own conformance checker: it must report zero errors and zero warnings for every encoded vector, so a container, accessor, skin or extension fault fails against an implementation this repository did not write."
    },
    {
